h4. Community

41chan is small and invite-only, and the booru is one part of it: the chat rooms are where people are, and most of what is posted here was posted there first.

h4. Expectations

* Tag what you upload and fix tags you know are wrong.
* Do not upload what is not allowed; see [[help:upload_rules]].
* Respect creators who keep their tags private.
* Disagreements about tags go through [[help:bulk_update_requests]], not edit wars.
* Report posts that break the rules rather than arguing about them on the post.

Staff can leave feedback on an account as a record. See [[help:user]].

h4. Getting in touch

[nodtext]@saber:41chan.net[/nodtext] on Matrix, or admin@fourier.channel.
